# agent-memory: the log is local to each container and its auto-extracted rows are not reviewed, so it is not committed.
# Standing rules live in AGENTS.md. (.memory/config.json and .memory/bin/ stay tracked.)
.memory/MEMORY.md
.memory/log/memories.jsonl
.memory/log/decisions.jsonl
